-# Bouncer
+# STEALTH
 
 **Know Your Agent — a trust gateway for AI-driven checkout.**
 
-Built for the Razorpay AI Buildathon by [Sujal Negi](https://sujalnegi.tech).
+Built for the Razorpay AI Buildathon by
+[Sujal Negi](https://sujalnegi.tech).
 
-[Bouncer](https://bouncerkya.onrender.com) sits between an AI shopping agent and Razorpay checkout. The agent presents a signed *mandate* that defines what it is allowed to buy, together with the cart it wants to purchase. Bouncer verifies the mandate, extracts evidence from the cart, asks an AI model to identify any mismatch, and then lets deterministic policy decide what happens.
-
-The important part is simple:
-
-> **The agent can propose a purchase. It cannot approve its own purchase.**
-
-A purchase can end in one of three ways:
+STEALTH sits between an AI shopping agent and Razorpay checkout. An agent
+presents a signed *mandate* (its spending authorization) together with the cart
+it wants to buy. STEALTH diffs the two and decides whether the purchase matches
+what the human actually authorized:
 
 | Outcome | Meaning |
 | --- | --- |
-| `ALLOW` | The cart is consistent with the signed mandate. |
-| `STEP_UP` | The result is ambiguous or the engine cannot safely decide, so a human must answer. |
-| `DECLINE` | The purchase is outside the mandate or the credential is invalid. |
-
-If an agent is hijacked by a prompt-injected product listing and tries to buy something outside its mandate, Bouncer checks the resulting cart against the authorization before anything reaches the payment rail.
-
----
-
-## Architecture
