+
+**Clause severity is not stable across identical input.** The seeded
+commercial-blender case (`req_C4E80B`) was run four times against the same
+model with the same input:
 
 | Run | Confidence | Severity | Outcome |
-| --- | ---: | --- | --- |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
 | 1 | 0.86 | high | DECLINE |
