+
+<span class="c"># you must see this, or stop and fix it:</span>
+<span class="c"># Outcomes: 1 ALLOW, 4 DECLINE, 3 STEP_UP</span>
+
+<span class="c"># now uncomment BOUNCER_ENGINE_PRESET and BOUNCER_ENGINE_API_KEY, then:</span>
+npm run dev</pre>
+  <div class="warn"><b>Do not reseed after starting the server.</b> The seeded rows keep their labelled diffs, and the live agent button gets a working model behind it. Reseeding undoes both. Tabs: Overview on <code>localhost:3000</code>, Approvals on <code>localhost:3000/approvals</code>. Window at 1440px, zoom 100%, dark theme, every other tab closed.</div>
+</div>
+
+
