+
+<p class="standfirst" style="margin-bottom:22px">Five nav sections. Only four controls in the whole product actually <i>do</i> something: the two live-agent buttons, the reveal chips, and Approve/Reject. Everything else is a link. Know where they are before you record so you are never hunting on camera.</p>
