+    <tr><td><code>adversarial run</code></td><td>top right, filled indigo</td><td><b>The demo button.</b> Runs the live agent against the poisoned listing. Streams a trace, then jumps you to the new request page.</td></tr>
+    <tr><td>Counter row</td><td>under the title</td><td>TOTAL, ALLOW, STEP UP, DECLINE, BLOCKED PRE-MODEL. On the right: <code>audit chain &middot; 8 events &middot; verified</code>.</td></tr>
+    <tr><td>Eight request cards</td><td>the list</td><td>Each is a link to its detail page. Named in English, outcome badge on the right.</td></tr>
+  </table>
+  <figure class="shot">
