+    <p class="lede">
+      STEALTH is a trust gateway between an AI shopping agent and Razorpay
+      checkout. An agent presents a signed mandate and a cart; STEALTH verifies
+      the credential, diffs the cart against what the human actually authorized,
+      and allows, blocks, or asks. A model is used for exactly one step, and it
+      never gets the final word.
